     "body": "<p>I've opened a PR for a basic export utility:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/6\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/6</a></p>\n\n<p>This keeps virtually all of my changes in the fcrepo-export module, but there's obviously a lot of config that should be shared with the import module coming in <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2130\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2130</a>.</p>",
